  "result": "```json\n{\n    \"smpl.ordering.PropertyHelper\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Helper class for loading and accessing application configuration properties from a properties file on the classpath. It automatically loads 'application.properties' at class initialization via a static initializer block, storing the result in a private static field `s_props`. Key methods include: `getPropValues(String propFileName)` — a static utility that loads and returns a `Properties` object from any named properties file on the classpath, throwing `FileNotFoundException` if the file is not found, and `getProperties()` — a static accessor that returns the pre-loaded `s_props` instance containing the values from 'application.properties'. If the file fails to load during static initialization, an empty `Properties` object is used as a fallback, ensuring the application does not crash on startup.\",\n        \"file_path\": \"smpl/ordering/PropertyHelper.java\"\n    }\n}\n```",
